*  fib.sno -- the Fibonacci numbers as far as this machine goes.
*  Part of github.com/mdhender/sil. BSD 2-Clause; see LICENSE.
*
*  Stopped at F(34) on purpose. SIZLIM here is 16777215 -- a 24-bit
*  value field, chosen in pkg/sil/copyseg/parms.sil -- and F(36) is
*  14930352, so F(37) is the first one this machine cannot hold. A
*  program that runs to F(40) elsewhere stops with an arithmetic error
*  here, and that is a property of the port and not of the program.
        A = 0
        B = 1
        N = 0
LOOP    OUTPUT = 'F(' N ') = ' A
        T = A + B
        A = B
        B = T
        N = LT(N,34) N + 1             :S(LOOP)
END
